Z||000003||elfiero||07-02-2001||02:25 PM||||yes,it's all inside the eng. compartment.I<BR>fabricated a bracket that uses a stock v6 or<BR>aftermarket poly engine mount and stock trans<BR>mounts slid to the left.I added a crossmember<BR>to front of the cradle because I cut the<BR>exsisting one out for starter clearance and<BR>exhaust clearance.If I email you some pics,<BR>would you post them here for me?(I don't have<BR>the software to do it myself)||||reg||6
