Z||000008||elfiero||07-05-2001||09:43 PM||||I'm working on the pictures,it seems they<BR>have become temporarily misplaced.stay tuned.<BR>brian;I fabricated a torque strut on the<BR>front side of the engine from the OEM motor<BR>mount boss to the new crossmember I added to<BR>the cradle.both ends of the new "dogbone"<BR>have poly bushings.||||reg||6
